Description:
{Chapel Guard + any Holy creature}
Your creatures in the lanes next to this creature take 1 less combat damage.

When one of your creatures would be destroyed: You may banish a fusion splice from under this creature. That creature survives with 1 HP instead.

{any 2 Noble creatures}
This creature has +3 ATK, +5 HP and +1 Speed for each fusion splice under it.

Put a 'Noble' creature from your Waste Repository under this creature as a fusion splice. You can only use this effect of Lord Lazarus once per turn.

{Blood Priest + any Unholy creature}
Banish 2 cards from your Waste Repository, or 1 fusion splice from under this creature: Restore 3 HP to a creature or gain 3 PHP. You can only use this effect of The Meat Cathedral once per turn.

Whenever you banish creature(s) this way: This creature gains +1 ATK permanently.

{any 2 Greedy creatures}
This creature rolls its die once for each fusion splice under it and keeps the highest result. (If it has no fusion splices, it rolls once.)

You may invest any amount of gold from your pool onto this creature. For each gold invested, choose +2 ATK or +2 HP permanently. You can only use this effect of Hop Goblin once per turn.

{Cat + Bunny}
If this creature doesn’t attack: Restore 1 HP to it at end phase.
Your opponent can only attack creatures with the name 'Bunny' or fusions which have splices named 'bunny' while this card is on the field.

{any 2 Ordinary creatures with different names}
Once per turn: Banish a fusion splice from under this creature to put a Complaint on each enemy creature.

(Complaint: the creature has -2 ATK for each one and its 'once per turn' effects don't work. Its controller may pay a 3 flux fine in their Main Phase to remove one.)

{any Unholy creature + any Greedy creature}
This creature has +1 ATK for each fusion splice under it.

Whenever another creature dies: Gain 1 gold or 1 PHP. If it was a creature you controlled (not a fusion), you may put it under this creature as a fusion splice instead.

{Judicator Angel + any Holy creature}
Radiance (the first time each turn this creature is restored past its max HP, it gains your choice of +ATK or +HP equal to the extra, until your next turn).

When this creature attacks: Restore 2 HP to each creature you control for each fusion splice under this creature.

{any Holy creature + any Greedy creature}
Radiance (the first time each turn this creature is restored past its max HP, it gains your choice of +ATK or +HP equal to the extra, until your next turn).

Pay any amount of gold: Restore that much HP to a creature you control. Each fusion splice you banish from under this creature counts as 2 gold. You can only use this effect of Indulgence Seller once per turn.

{any 2 or 3 creatures}
Feeble fusion: 2 or 3 of your creatures in lanes next to each other, of any flux cost, as long as their printed flux costs add up to 7 or more (a fusion counts as 5). With 3, it takes the middle lane.

Execute (when this creature deals combat damage to a creature, if that creature has half its max HP or less left, destroy it).

{any 2 Heavy fusions}
This creature has +1 ATK for each fusion splice under it.







In awe at the size of this lad.
